      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4efeb] border border-[#12281b]/10 text-xs text-[#2e5339] space-y-1.5 font-mono">
        <div><strong>Status:</strong> Pending Confirmation (Honor System)</div>
        <div><strong>Deposit:</strong> ฿0 Required (Pay on arrival)</div>
        <div><strong>Cancellation:</strong> Free cancellation anytime</div>
